{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "165dc078-8d52-44fe-aedb-f67b5b724be0",
    "name": "API Tests",
    "description": "Cette collection teste les endpoints REST critiques de l'application OWASP Juice Shop (application volontairement vulnérable utilisée pour l'apprentissage de la sécurité web).\n\nObjectif : valider le comportement des fonctionnalités principales — authentification, gestion du panier, recherche de produits, et création de commandes.\n\nStructure :\n\n- 11 requêtes couvrant : Login, Register, Search product, Get product detail, Get/Add/Update/Delete basket, Get non-existent product (404), Create order (B2B), Get user whoami\n    \n- Authentification gérée via JWT, capturé automatiquement au login et réutilisé via la variable {{token}}\n    \n- Deux environnements disponibles : Dev (local) et Test\n    \n\nEnvironnements requis : sélectionner \"Dev - Juice Shop\" ou \"Test - Juice Shop\" avant l'exécution.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52033155"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().authentication.token);\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {\r",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.test(\"Response has a token\", function () {\r",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.authentication.token).to.be.a('string');\r",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.authentication.token).to.include('eyJ');\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.test(\"Response time is acceptable\", function () {\r",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000);\r",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n  \"email\": \"admin@juice-sh.op\",\r\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/user/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "rest",
            "user",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "StartFragmentAuthentifie un utilisateur avec email/password. Capture automatiquement le JWT retourné dans la variable `{{token}}` via un script post-response. Réponse attendue : 200 OK.EndFragment"
      },
      "response": []
    },
